 that we're doing enough for  that and it's difficult to get law  schools to teach law students about  practical things to begin with and I  think that that's especially challenging  with new technologies and I completely  agree that's something that there should  be more awareness raised in law schools  that these legal issues are things that  law student should be examining now  because they're the ones who are going  to be both help shaping the policy in  the future and representing clients and  individual cases where they're at issue  [Music]

